Judg 15:1 , Samson is denied his wife;
Judg 15:3 , He burns the Philistines' corn with foxes and firebrands;
Judg 15:6 , His wife and her father are burnt by the Philistines;
Judg 15:7 , Samson smites them hip and thigh;
Judg 15:9 , He is bound by the men of Judah, and delivered to the Philistines;
Judg 15:14 , He kills them with a jawbone;
Judg 15:18 , God makes the fountain En-hakkore for him in Lehi.
